{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "其象年二十，額上自有文裂，即\n有流脂，異種極香"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "以大指頭指撚藥丸，指融塗上。\n又取竹膜貼蠟上，意不欲上有指文印藥上。若有指文，藥無靈驗也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "夜合樹亦得"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "凡人一肘量"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "金銀銅鐵錫"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "分酥供養及日蝕，如前法中"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "亦云蜜相木"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "香摩如泥"}
